From behind Léa's shoulder, Pic the small hedgehog trots across the wet grass of the garden lawn with a stuffed plush rabbit resting across his brown spiny back, his cream face and dark pink nose pointing forward into the dusk. Pic has short brown spines tipped darker brown, rounded ears with cream rims, and small soft paws moving through scattered red and gold maple leaves. Near the camera in an over-the-shoulder crop, Léa shows only the back of her head with straight dark brown chin-length hair and the shoulder of her red flannel pyjama top as she looks straight ahead into the garden, where autumn trees stand dark against the evening sky.

