Jules, a young school-age boy with short straight dark brown hair, blue eyes, and soft features, sprints forward across the wet green lawn with his body leaning into the stride, both hands gripping a black plastic flashlight as its round beam cuts across the grass toward the weathered wooden shed at the far end of the garden. He wears a green crew-neck wool jumper, grey corduroy trousers, and blue canvas trainers. In the distance near the base of the shed, Pic the spiny brown hedgehog scurries quickly with wide startled dark eyes and a tucked snout, dragging the pale grey stuffed rabbit as his hindquarters slip into the dark opening beneath the wooden boards among scattered autumn leaves. Wide shot of the evening lawn under the dusk sky.

